# Web client

Follow [design.md](../../design.md) for tokens, primitives, and core rules.

- Functional React and plain CSS. This is Vite, not Next.js: no Server Components, Server Actions, `next/image`, or `use client`.
- Persisted project state stays in the application service. Local state is selection, panels, and unsaved edits.
- Parse external responses with shared core schemas. Reuse the connection hook and drop obsolete responses.
- Keep artwork legible. Use real thumbnails and only recorded crops. Verify changed screens in a browser at desktop width. Phone layout is not required.
